# IMPORTANT (xun / SM6225):
# Stock vendor_boot.img is 96 MB and strictly validated by the bootloader.
# The generated pmOS vendor_boot (~8 MB) is REJECTED (immediate reboot to
# fastboot). Always keep the STOCK vendor_boot.img and only replace boot.
#
# Flash procedure:
#   fastboot flash boot_a boot.img
#   fastboot flash vendor_boot_a <stock-vendor_boot.img>
#   fastboot set_active a
#   fastboot reboot
#
# recovery.img is a copy of the patched boot.img (for recovery_a if needed).
